OL,3,GNEWSAPolice arrest 36 in raids on
OL,4,AVietnamese crime gangs linked to human
OL,5,Atrafficking
OL,6,
OL,7,FOne of Scotland's biggest police
OL,8,Foperations has targeted a Vietnamese
OL,9,Forganised crime group linked to human
OL,10,Ftrafficking and cannabis farms.
OL,12,FAbout 300 officers took part in
OL,13,Fsimultaneous early-morning raids,
OL,14,Fleading to the arrest of 36 people and
OL,15,Fthe discovery of 14 cannabis-growing
OL,16,Foperations.
OL,18,FIn total, police searched or checked 47
OL,19,Faddresses in Aberdeen, Dundee, Falkirk,
OL,20,FEdinburgh, Glasgow, Ayrshire,
OL,21,FLanarkshire, Midlothian and the
OL,22,FScottish Borders.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,428,420,260,160,0,100
