OL,3,GNEWSAPolice arrest 36 in raids on
OL,4,AVietnamese crime gangs linked to human
OL,5,Atrafficking
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolice Scotland allege the gang is
OL,8,Finvolved in "poly-criminality,"
OL,9,Fincluding human trafficking, drug
OL,10,Fproduction, fraud, money laundering and
OL,11,Forganised immigration crime.
